        answer: "From the US, file a complaint with the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau and the state agency named on your receipt. From the UK, give the provider 15 business days for a final response under FCA rules, then take it to the Financial Ombudsman Service within six months of that response; it is free. In the EU, providers must reply within 15 business days, or 35 at most, and FIN-NET lists the national dispute bodies.",
