        answer: "Up to ₹10 lakh in a financial year across all your LRS transfers, under section 394 of the Income-tax Act, 2025. Above that, banks collect 2% on the excess for education or medical treatment and 20% for other purposes. Education paid from a loan by a bank or notified financial institution carries no TCS at any amount. Overseas tour packages differ: since 1 April 2026, tour operators collect 2% from the first rupee under the Finance Act, 2026.",
